---
/**
 * What a reader gets when they land on a post that is still `backlog: "wip"`.
 *
 * The page exists and is indexable on purpose — that is how the entry starts
 * ranking while it is being written — but the notes themselves live in Notion
 * until they are worth publishing, so the body is replaced by this instead of
 * shipping a half-written post.
 *
 * The sources still render below: they are real, they are already useful, and
 * they are the honest part of an unfinished entry.
 */
import styles from "./wip-notice.module.css";
---

<aside class={styles.notice}>
	<p class={styles.badge}>
		<span aria-hidden="true">🚧</span> Estoy estudiándolo
	</p>
	<p class={styles.text}>
		Todavía estoy leyendo y tomando notas sobre esto, así que aún no hay nada
		que merezca la pena publicar. Debajo están las fuentes de las que estoy
		tirando, por si quieres adelantarte.
	</p>
</aside>
